  "limits": [
    "A short local sample of the original API/Worker, PostgreSQL/Redis containers and Builder. It is not a capacity or sustained-load test.",
    "Mac process RSS, Docker Linux working-set estimates, Builder service cgroup accounting and whole-guest memory are different scopes; they are not added together.",
    "Builder systemd MainPID is the flock wrapper. Node RSS is observed separately for the service child executable; cgroup memory covers the whole service including cache.",
    "Mac CPU totals have ps display precision; container CPU percentages and memory sizes retain Docker CLI sampling/rounding semantics. Builder CPU uses its own monotonic clock.",
    "Normal observers and the read-only queries continue. Console/Vite, fixture/proxy processes, Docker VM overhead and application-cluster capacity are not measured here.",
    "All workloads and virtual machines share one physical Mac. These readings are not Oracle/VPS resource guarantees."
  ],
